{"person":"person:canon:xuzhu","as_name":"梦郎","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":"place:canon:bingku","believed_by":[],"ch":[37,37],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[37,21,0,6,"f4798900813c37c7"]],"note":"童姥借梦姑对他的昵称来逗弄他，李秋水也跟着这样叫他；本回里他对这个称呼又羞又窘"}
{"person":"person:canon:xuzhu","as_name":"粉面郎君武潘安","kind":"false_identity","when":null,"where":"place:canon:bingku","believed_by":["person:canon:liqiushui"],"ch":[37,37],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[37,19,64,71,"531e7f45a6c3f052"]],"note":"童姥当场编出的外号，把他说成中原头号风流美少年，意在引李秋水现身；李秋水将信将疑，后来看清他的真容才识破"}
